Z||000001||Shaun41178||04-18-2001||04:51 PM||||Dude I would go with poly if I were you.  Don't go back to rubber mounts especially if you plan on running more power through it.  plus it will probably add a pony or two at the wheels as the engine won't move as much so more power can reach the ground.  Thats what I would do anyways<P>It looks like West coast has some pretty good motor and tranny mounts too from what I can tell in the pics.  <P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
